    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check this out</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1733865570\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/7874f2b8ddfde544507ffe0b3a4d514b.poster.avif?t=1733865570\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/7874f2b8ddfde544507ffe0b3a4d514b.webm?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/7874f2b8ddfde544507ffe0b3a4d514b.mp4?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Dive into the sunken world. Face the dangers of the deepness. Build a colony and make it thrive. Conquer or explore the unknown, you decide which way you choose.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/ae8c0fe626745d41340422c759f23e21.poster.avif?t=1733865570\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/ae8c0fe626745d41340422c759f23e21.webm?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/ae8c0fe626745d41340422c759f23e21.mp4?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Find food, treat the water, and provide electricity. Let scientists research and the military to fight, take in citizens to start a new underwater life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/21d45c802a2a723b8d428fe2cddda000.poster.avif?t=1733865570\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/21d45c802a2a723b8d428fe2cddda000.webm?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/21d45c802a2a723b8d428fe2cddda000.mp4?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In this alien environment, not everything is as simple as on the surface. Collect resources to expand your colony, discover new technologies and bring them to life. Generate energy so machines can work for people. Getting food and clean water may prove to be more difficult than it sounds.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/8eacb12508f2b74f48b839d199aefee9.poster.avif?t=1733865570\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/8eacb12508f2b74f48b839d199aefee9.webm?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/8eacb12508f2b74f48b839d199aefee9.mp4?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Use new technologies to create bio-mechs that will help you survive. Catch creatures and bio-modify them, giving them unprecedented possibilities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/d757b8193c2367657e151ea803980248.poster.avif?t=1733865570\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/d757b8193c2367657e151ea803980248.webm?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/d757b8193c2367657e151ea803980248.mp4?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Remember that you are not alone. It's a huge world full of all kinds of creatures, from small fish to giant monsters that threaten your colony. Be watchful!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1733865570\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/7874f2b8ddfde544507ffe0b3a4d514b.poster.avif?t=1733865570\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/7874f2b8ddfde544507ffe0b3a4d514b.webm?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/7874f2b8ddfde544507ffe0b3a4d514b.mp4?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Dive into the sunken world. Face the dangers of the deepness. Build a colony and make it thrive. Conquer or explore the unknown, you decide which way you choose.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/ae8c0fe626745d41340422c759f23e21.poster.avif?t=1733865570\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/ae8c0fe626745d41340422c759f23e21.webm?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611950/extras/ae8c0fe626745d41340422c759f23e21.mp4?t=1733865570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>